OpenClaw Enterprise adapted dataplane

This directory contains selected components derived from Dream Serpent (DS),
https://github.com/freeqaz/ds, public baseline
 dccf15c760e219ab7bf284c7c2b52b62b9d925ef.

The DS source is licensed under Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE. Existing source
copyright and attribution notices are retained. Modified source files carry an
OpenClaw Enterprise modification notice. SOURCE_MANIFEST.json identifies the
selected source files and their hashes. This component's license is separate
from the surrounding repository's license.

OCE adaptations include the fixed-origin external model DNS and TLS adapters,
current-authority and one-shot operation binding, explicit socket cancellation,
fallible nftables and conntrack cleanup, policy/admission consistency fixes,
shared-memory validation fixes, and the selected build and test inputs.
The HTTP adapter uses Hyper and rustls. Stock DS executables, identity issuance,
host/VM networking and collector deployment are not selected products.

Third-party Cargo and Rust standard-library notices are retained in
third-party-notices/. That inventory covers the selected Linux build graph;
it is not an assertion that every listed component is linked into each binary.
Container base and operating-system package notices are separate.
